  "description": "meme-id: officer_down; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image displays a lightning bolt icon with the text 'officer down' above it. This is a common meme format used to indicate that a police officer has been killed or incapacitated, often in a humorous or ironic context. The lightning bolt symbolizes suddenness or a dramatic event. While not inherently abusive or hateful, the meme can be harmful when used to trivialize or mock real-life incidents of police violence or officer deaths, potentially desensitizing viewers to the gravity of such events. The intent is to create a visual shorthand for a serious situation, but its use can be contextually inappropriate or insensitive, especially if deployed without regard for the real-world consequences of police violence or the loss of life.",
